<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; PROVISIONAL machine alignment reconciled by Codex. g-yog 'khor owns people who work as a d3 servant-group recast; the supplied around you stays unwrapped. The later 'khor owns people only. ma nges pa'i spobs owns lack of confidence as a contextual d3 recast, with no dictionary claim that ma nges pa alone means lack here. The help passage recasts seeking unhelpfulness as finding oneself without help; that agency remains unresolved and its predicates are omitted. The help/benefit noun is also omitted because the cursor would resolve phan pa within the disputed first negative phrase rather than the intended second occurrence. The active and passive harm predicates retain their respective others occurrences. skur pa mang and the respect/value elaboration remain unpaired. Repeated final gsungs, personality, intensifiers, supplied possessors and auxiliaries are omitted. No uncertainty is represented as null.</div>
